      <div><strong>15+ years</strong><span>Across AI, software, cloud, data, and infrastructure delivery.</span></div>
      <div><strong>CAD $1M+</strong><span>Proposal development and technical evaluation, partnering with a VP through contract selection and award.</span></div>
